================================================================================
Fonts
================================================================================

Open Glean uses Inter (SIL Open Font License 1.1) as its UI font, loaded at runtime
via next/font/google. No font binaries are distributed with this repository.
The monospace stack (ui-monospace, "Geist Mono", monospace) references system
and Google Font families; the app falls back to the system monospace font when
Geist Mono is unavailable. No commercial typefaces are included.
